---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="sbp10windowsbars">
  <div class="sbp10windowsbars-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 304" role="img" aria-label="Net result after fees and tax of buying every month versus one lump sum on the VN-Index, in three 24-month windows.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>The same 120,000,000 VND in three 24-month windows of the VN-Index</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng 120.000.000 đồng trong ba cửa sổ 24 tháng của VN-Index</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="44" width="12" height="12" rx="2" class="bar-green" /><text x="38" y="55" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Buy every month</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mua đều mỗi tháng</tspan></text>
      <rect x="190" y="44" width="12" height="12" rx="2" class="bar-gold" /><text x="208" y="55" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Lump sum on day one</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một lần ngày đầu</tspan></text>
      <line x1="70" y1="230.0" x2="880" y2="230.0" class="ln" />
      <text x="62" y="234.0" class="m" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>-20%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>-20%</tspan></text>
      <line x1="70" y1="190.0" x2="880" y2="190.0" class="ln" />
      <text x="62" y="194.0" class="m" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>-10%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>-10%</tspan></text>
      <line x1="70" y1="110.0" x2="880" y2="110.0" class="ln" />
      <text x="62" y="114.0" class="m" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>+10%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>+10%</tspan></text>
      <line x1="70" y1="70.0" x2="880" y2="70.0" class="ln" />
      <text x="62" y="74.0" class="m" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>+20%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>+20%</tspan></text>
      <line x1="70" y1="150" x2="880" y2="150" class="axis" />
      <text x="62" y="154" class="m" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>0%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>0%</tspan></text>
      <rect x="102" y="150.0" width="84" height="82.7" class="bar-green" />
      <text x="144" y="248.7" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>-20.7%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>-20,7%</tspan></text>
      <rect x="206" y="150.0" width="84" height="20.3" class="bar-gold" />
      <text x="248" y="186.3" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>-5.1%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>-5,1%</tspan></text>
      <text x="207" y="290" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Jan 2021 to Dec 2022</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1/2021 đến 12/2022</tspan></text>
      <rect x="372" y="150.0" width="84" height="13.0" class="bar-green" />
      <text x="414" y="179.0" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>-3.2%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>-3,2%</tspan></text>
      <rect x="476" y="150.0" width="84" height="95.6" class="bar-gold" />
      <text x="518" y="261.6" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>-23.9%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>-23,9%</tspan></text>
      <text x="477" y="290" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Jan 2022 to Dec 2023</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1/2022 đến 12/2023</tspan></text>
      <rect x="642" y="119.8" width="84" height="30.2" class="bar-green" />
      <text x="684" y="112.8" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>+7.5%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>+7,5%</tspan></text>
      <rect x="746" y="95.8" width="84" height="54.2" class="bar-gold" />
      <text x="788" y="88.8" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>+13.5%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>+13,5%</tspan></text>
      <text x="747" y="290" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Jan 2023 to Dec 2024</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1/2023 đến 12/2024</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>After a 0.15% fee on each order and the 0.1% sale tax. Buying every month finished ahead when prices fell first and behind when they rose from the start.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Sau phí 0,15% mỗi lệnh và thuế bán 0,1%. Mua đều về đích trước khi giá giảm trước, và sau khi giá tăng ngay từ đầu.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
   .sbp10windowsbars { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp10windowsbars-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
   .sbp10windowsbars svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
   .sbp10windowsbars text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
   .sbp10windowsbars .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10windowsbars .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10windowsbars .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10windowsbars .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
   .sbp10windowsbars .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10windowsbars .green { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10windowsbars .gold { fill: var(--act-1); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10windowsbars .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
   .sbp10windowsbars .card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10windowsbars .card-green { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10windowsbars .card-gold { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10windowsbars .ln { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10windowsbars .axis { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10windowsbars .dash { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
   .sbp10windowsbars .arw { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
   .sbp10windowsbars .arw-h { fill: var(--text-muted); }
   .sbp10windowsbars .bar-red { fill: var(--red); }
   .sbp10windowsbars .bar-green { fill: var(--act-2); }
   .sbp10windowsbars .bar-gold { fill: var(--gold); }
   .sbp10windowsbars .bar-mut { fill: var(--text-faint); }
   .sbp10windowsbars .path-line { fill: none; stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10windowsbars .path-red { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10windowsbars .dot { fill: var(--act-2); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10windowsbars .dot-red { fill: var(--red); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10windowsbars figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
